						],
						"pointId": 11834
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 150480101,
					"content": "...I'm sorry, but we can't let you take that risk.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Gaun"
				},
				{
					"id": 150480102,
					"content": "But that's not what you said earlier...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150480103,
					"content": "Our sincerest apologies. We may be pressed for time, but the safety of our visitors has to come first. We hope you understand.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Gaun"
				},
				{
					"id": 150480104,
					"content": "#Oh, {NICKNAME}! Perfect timing! Could you help me talk this gentleman around?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150480105,
					"content": "They need someone for the testing, so I went over all my adventuring experience, made it clear I was willing to accept any risks... It was all going so well...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150480106,
					"content": "But the minute I mentioned some of the close calls I've had in the past, he flat-out refused to let me take part.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150480107,
					"content": "Sir, I appreciate your enthusiasm, I truly do.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Gaun"
				},
				{
					"id": 150480108,
					"content": "But if you, in your own words, have a tendency to fall into rivers even when you're crossing a bridge made of solid stone, it might be better to try something a little more... laid-back? Like, lounging on one of those beach chairs over there.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Gaun"
				},
				{
					"id": 150480109,
					"content": "*sigh* But... I really am an adventurer, and I'm qualified for the testing too! I've just... had some bad luck in the past, that's all...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150480110,
					"content": "I really want to help. You can count on me, I swear!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480111,
						150480112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150480111,
					"content": "I can vouch for him.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150480113,
					"content": "Well, if the savior of Natlan says so... How about this — would it be alright if your Asha companion completed the first round of testing instead?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Gaun"
				},
				{
					"id": 150480114,
					"content": "You can watch from the sidelines, familiarize yourself with the route, and if everything goes smoothly, you can join the second round of testing.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Gaun"
				},
				{
					"id": 150480115,
					"content": "Does that sound good to you, buddy?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150480116,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Asha"
				},
				{
					"id": 150480117,
					"content": "Alright then! I'll leave it to you, partner!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150480112,
					"content": "He has my full confidence.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480113
					]
				}
			]
		},
